---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Get On Cutline — Setup Guides">
  <h1>Get On Cutline</h1>

  <section class="intro">
    <p class="lead">
      Configure your device to use Cutline's encrypted DNS resolvers. For the shortest path, use the 
      one-tap setup below. Manual DNS addresses:
    </p>
    <div class="resolver-box">
      <code class="ip">64.176.200.99</code>
      <code class="ip">149.28.79.49</code>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="platform-nav">
    <a href="#encrypted">Encrypted DNS (One-Tap)</a>
    <a href="#router">Router</a>
    <a href="#macos">macOS</a>
    <a href="#iphone">iPhone/iPad</a>
    <a href="#windows">Windows</a>
    <a href="#android">Android</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="encrypted" class="encrypted-section">
    <h2>Encrypted DNS (One-Tap Setup)</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Cutline now supports <strong>DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH)</strong> and <strong>DNS-over-TLS (DoT)</strong>. 
      These encrypt your DNS queries end-to-end.
    </p>

    <div class="encrypted-grid">
      <div class="encrypted-card">
        <h3>📱 iPhone, iPad, and Mac</h3>
        <p>Download and install the configuration profile for one-tap encrypted DNS setup. Works on iOS/iPadOS 14+ and macOS 11+.</p>
        <div class="warning-inline">
          <strong>⚠️ iCloud Private Relay:</strong> If Private Relay is on, Apple bypasses Cutline DNS entirely and the cut will not work. 
          Turn Private Relay off: <strong>Settings → [your name] → iCloud → Private Relay → Off</strong>.
        </div>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Open this page in Safari</strong> (profiles only work in Safari)</li>
          <li>Tap the button below to download the profile</li>
          <li>Go to <strong>Settings → Profile Downloaded → Install</strong></li>
          <li>Enter your passcode and tap <strong>Install</strong></li>
          <li>The install screen should show <strong>Verified</strong></li>
        </ol>
        <a href="/cutline-dns.mobileconfig" class="download-button" download>
          Download Cutline DNS Profile
        </a>
        <p class="note">
          <strong>Signed profile.</strong> Removable anytime from Settings → General → VPN & Device Management. 
          Not MDM, not a content filter. Configures DoH for all networks, including cellular data.
        </p>
        <p class="note-mac">
          <strong>Mac users:</strong> If a previous install failed, delete any leftover "Downloaded" profile 
          in System Settings → General → Device Management, then download again.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="encrypted-card">
        <h3>🤖 Android</h3>
        <p>Android 9+ has built-in encrypted DNS support.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong></li>
          <li>Go to <strong>Network & internet</strong></li>
          <li>Tap <strong>Private DNS</strong></li>
          <li>Select <strong>Private DNS provider hostname</strong></li>
          <li>Enter: <code class="inline-code">dns.thecutline.org</code></li>
          <li>Tap <strong>Save</strong></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="note">
          This configures DNS-over-TLS (DoT) system-wide, including mobile data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="encrypted-card">
        <h3>🪟 Windows</h3>
        <p>Download and run the one-click installer (requires Administrator).</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Download the installer using the button below</li>
          <li>Double-click <strong>cutline-dns-setup.exe</strong></li>
          <li>Approve the UAC prompt (User Account Control)</li>
          <li>The installer configures encrypted DNS on all network adapters</li>
          <li>Done! Visit <a href="/verify">/verify</a> to confirm</li>
        </ol>
        <a href="/cutline-dns-setup.exe" class="download-button" download>
          Download Windows Installer
        </a>
        <p class="note">
          <strong>Windows SmartScreen:</strong> The installer is unsigned (v1). If SmartScreen blocks it, 
          click <strong>More info</strong> → <strong>Run anyway</strong>. Works on Windows 10 and 11.
        </p>
        <p class="note">
          <strong>To uninstall:</strong> Settings → Apps → Cutline DNS → Uninstall
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="technical-details">
      <h3>Technical Details</h3>
      <div class="details-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>DoH Endpoint:</strong><br>
          <code class="inline-code">https://dns.thecutline.org/dns-query</code><br>
          <small>(application/dns-message)</small>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>DoT Endpoint:</strong><br>
          <code class="inline-code">dns.thecutline.org:853</code><br>
          <small>TLS, SAN dns.thecutline.org</small>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>IP Addresses:</strong><br>
          <code class="inline-code">64.176.200.99</code><br>
          <code class="inline-code">149.28.79.49</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="router">
    <h2>Router (Whole Network)</h2>
    <p>
      Setting DNS on your router applies the cut path to all devices on your network. 
      <strong>Note:</strong> Some ISPs lock router DNS settings. If you cannot change DNS, 
      configure individual devices instead.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open your router's admin panel (usually http://192.168.1.1 or http://192.168.0.1)</li>
      <li>Log in with your router credentials</li>
      <li>Find the DNS settings (often under "Internet", "WAN", or "DHCP")</li>
      <li>Set Primary DNS to <code>64.176.200.99</code></li>
      <li>Set Secondary DNS to <code>149.28.79.49</code></li>
      <li>Save and reboot the router</li>
      <li>Restart devices or renew DHCP to pick up new DNS</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="macos">
    <h2>macOS</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <strong>System Settings</strong></li>
      <li>Click <strong>Network</strong></li>
      <li>Select your active connection (Wi-Fi or Ethernet)</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Details</strong></li>
      <li>Go to the <strong>DNS</strong> tab</li>
      <li>Click the <strong>+</strong> button to add DNS servers</li>
      <li>Add <code>64.176.200.99</code> and <code>149.28.79.49</code></li>
      <li>Remove any other DNS servers</li>
      <li>Click <strong>OK</strong>, then <strong>Apply</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="iphone">
    <h2>iPhone/iPad</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Recommended:</strong> Use the <a href="#encrypted">Apple Configuration Profile</a> above 
      for encrypted DNS on all networks, including cellular.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Alternative (Wi-Fi only, unencrypted):</strong> Configure DNS manually for a specific Wi-Fi network.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Wi-Fi</strong></li>
      <li>Tap the <strong>ⓘ</strong> next to your connected network</li>
      <li>Scroll down and tap <strong>Configure DNS</strong></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Manual</strong></li>
      <li>Remove existing servers (swipe left and delete)</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Add Server</strong> and enter <code>64.176.200.99</code></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Add Server</strong> and enter <code>149.28.79.49</code></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Save</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="windows">
    <h2>Windows 10/11</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Recommended:</strong> Use the <a href="#encrypted">one-click installer</a> above 
      for encrypted DNS (DoH) with proper configuration. It covers all network adapters, 
      disables IPv6 to prevent leaks, and automatically configures new adapters when you 
      connect to a new network.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Alternative (unencrypted):</strong> Manually configure DNS servers.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong></li>
      <li>Go to <strong>Network & Internet</strong></li>
      <li>Click your connection type (Wi-Fi or Ethernet)</li>
      <li>Click the network name or <strong>Properties</strong></li>
      <li>Scroll down and click <strong>Edit</strong> under IP assignment or DNS</li>
      <li>Change DNS to <strong>Manual</strong></li>
      <li>Turn on <strong>IPv4</strong></li>
      <li>Set Preferred DNS to <code>64.176.200.99</code></li>
      <li>Set Alternate DNS to <code>149.28.79.49</code></li>
      <li>Click <strong>Save</strong></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">
      <strong>Note:</strong> Manual configuration only affects the current adapter. 
      The one-click installer handles all adapters and prevents IPv6 leaks automatically.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="android">
    <h2>Android</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Recommended:</strong> Use <a href="#encrypted">Private DNS (DoT)</a> above for 
      encrypted DNS on all networks, including mobile data.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Alternative (Wi-Fi only, unencrypted):</strong> Manually configure DNS for a specific Wi-Fi network.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Network & Internet</strong> or <strong>Connections</strong></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Wi-Fi</strong></li>
      <li>Long-press or tap the gear icon for your connected network</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Modify</strong> or <strong>Manage network settings</strong></li>
      <li>Expand <strong>Advanced options</strong></li>
      <li>Change IP settings to <strong>Static</strong></li>
      <li>Scroll to DNS fields</li>
      <li>Set DNS 1 to <code>64.176.200.99</code></li>
      <li>Set DNS 2 to <code>149.28.79.49</code></li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Save</strong></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">
      <strong>Note:</strong> Steps may vary by Android version and manufacturer.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="next-step">
    <h2>Next: Verify It Works</h2>
    <p>
      After configuring DNS, test that you're using the cut path.
    </p>
    <a href="/verify" class="cta-button">How to Verify →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .intro {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .resolver-box {
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ip {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .platform-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .platform-nav a {
    padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-md);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .platform-nav a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  section {
    margin: var(--spacing-2xl) 0;
  }

  h3 {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  ol {
    padding-left: var(--spacing-lg);
    margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  code {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .inline-code {
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .encrypted-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-card-bg) 0%, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.05) 100%);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin: var(--spacing-2xl) 0;
  }

  .encrypted-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    margin: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
  }

  .encrypted-card {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .encrypted-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .encrypted-card ol {
    margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
  }

  .download-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-lg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .download-button:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    text-decoration: none;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    padding: var(--spacing-sm);
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .note-mac {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-sm);
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .warning-inline {
    background: #fff3cd;
    border: 2px solid #ffc107;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
    margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .warning-inline strong {
    color: #856404;
  }

  .technical-details {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .details-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .details-grid small {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .note-small {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #856404;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: var(--spacing-xs) 0;
  }

  .profile-card {
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .coming-soon-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    background: #f0f0f0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .domain-info {
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .next-step {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--spacing-xl);
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: white;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    text-decoration: none;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .resolver-box {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .ip {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .platform-nav {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
